{"id":"n75473-1-9","stage":5,"title":"종전 · 从前","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75473-1-9-1","ko":"유민이가 종전과는 다른 행동을 보이더라.","zh":"裕敏的表现和以前不太一样呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"종전과는","meaning":"从前，以前","explanation":"종전：从前，以前；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"종전","audio":"/audio/e7dfc2073891ae47da14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75473","senseId":"1","lemma":"종전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행동을","meaning":"行动，行为，举动","explanation":"행동：行动，行为，举动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"행동","audio":"/audio/c0a59131a2a5be2a5183.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72478","senseId":"1","lemma":"행동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이더라.","meaning":"显露，露出","explanation":"보이다：显露，露出；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"2","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e7dfc2073891ae47","term":"종전","zh":"从前，以前","audio":"/audio/e7dfc2073891ae47da14.mp3","entryId":"75473","definition":"指比现在早一些的时候。","pronunciation":["종전"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"c0a59131a2a5be2a","term":"행동","zh":"行动，行为，举动","audio":"/audio/c0a59131a2a5be2a5183.mp3","entryId":"72478","definition":"活动身体做某种事情或动作。","pronunciation":["행동"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"显露，露出","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"观察对象而了解其内容或状态。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/adc911a4e82387129944.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75473-1-9-2","ko":"그래? 그 애에게 어떤 큰 심경의 변화라도 생겼나?","zh":"是吗？她是不是发生了什么重大的心理变化？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"他","explanation":"그：他","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"애에게","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심경의","meaning":"心境，心情，心态","explanation":"심경：心境，心情，心态；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"심경","audio":"/audio/2baf5c4b8f3b65aa57df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66252","senseId":"1","lemma":"심경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변화라도","meaning":"变化","explanation":"변화：变化；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"변화","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83169","senseId":"1","lemma":"변화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼나?","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"他","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代对话双方以外的人。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"2baf5c4b8f3b65aa","term":"심경","zh":"心境，心情，心态","audio":"/audio/2baf5c4b8f3b65aa57df.mp3","entryId":"66252","definition":"内心的状态。","pronunciation":["심경"]},{"id":"d06231d77cebc3d0","term":"변화","zh":"变化","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3","entryId":"83169","definition":"某物的样子、状态或性质等变得不同。","pronunciation":["변ː화"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d41cc0bfda225dd575c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75473","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？她是不是发生了什么重大的心理变化？","承奎闹着玩，把这个花瓶打碎了。","裕敏的表现和以前不太一样呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？她是不是发生了什么重大的心理变化？","裕敏的表现和以前不太一样呢。","承奎闹着玩，把这个花瓶打碎了。"],"answer":0}]}
